Thanks again to [b]streamers[/b] around the world, [b]contributors[/b] in steam community and [b]gamers[/b] from LoG official forum. We have also received much love from game medias like [b]4players[/b], [b]Game*Spark[/b] and [b]Famitsu[/b]. [i]Dungeon of Dragon Knight[/i] is getting better and better with your support.

Now we proudly announce that the [b]mac version[/b] of [i]Dungeon of Dragon Knight[/i] will be released on [b]13th September[/b].  In Mac version, you’ll experience:

1.The game music set from [b]Tetsuya Shibata[/b], who has made music for [i]Final Fantasy[/i] series, [i]Bio Hazard[/i] series and [i]Monster Hunter[/i] series;

2.[b]More levels[/b], mainly are challenging because all the monsters in these levels can re-spawn, which let players get more bonus;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34096850/b513cd4997e9dce627293de87dbc823e507905e6.gif[/img]

3.[b]More traps[/b], including chest bomb, saws coming out from walls, bear traps and etc., which are very different from other dungeon crawler game;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34096850/9e1885d6c27fa1e1e507a3f1821f16fff87991ef.gif[/img]

4.Useful [b]Statistics[/b], including play time, grids you’ve covered, total amount of money collection, experience gained, monster killed, secret places you’ve explored and the [b]rank[/b] you’ve gained in the game, there are more specific information you’ll get on the map in the game;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34096850/b8c7ef3a8c55d21344f18a006e5b39b526d615fa.jpg[/img]

5.[b]Player’s guide step by step IN GAME[/b].  You’ll learn how to use torch, fight to monsters, discover secret places and solve puzzles in the game;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34096850/b3fc1983d44ddc4603d432a89b44bdd6e6fb477c.gif[/img]

6.[b]Much easier magic casting system[/b].  You can choose the way to cast magic spells, which are [b]rune combination system[/b] or just [b]cast the spells directly[/b] in the setting menu.  With the player guide, you can play the game without any problem by choosing direct magic casting system;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34096850/353fd097bc59563c23e47fd49fc0ad8f53a67fee.gif[/img]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34096850/61fbe66b949cea3c35dca9ac89f6324336a2e6cb.gif[/img]

7.Fighter and Ranger in the game now have [b]special skill[/b] to do melee attack.  And more, [b]duel wielding[/b] skill, which has been asked frequently in steam community, has been added finally.  The [b]warlord class[/b] is rare in dungeon crawler games, we’ve added fire and dark magic to this class, so the class is [b]unique[/b], which provides more combination for the team and more fun for playing the game;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34096850/c2180da2b149ca29e77ef31c7bd519510867d79b.gif[/img]

8.Have you “really” talked to the [b]lady[/b] in the tavern, you should try, lol

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34096850/e3537ebc8912c3fbef535114b03af60f8809c67e.gif[/img]

